    right.\n\nMove Up & Down\nLook at your right controller and press the two buttons
    near your thumb to move up or down.\n\nGrab Data\nUse the trigger (middle finger)
    to grab and move data.\n\nBring / Push Data\nWhile holding data, move the right
    stick forward or backward to pull it closer or push it away.\n\nReset Data Position\nPress
    the lower button on your left controller (the one with the circular arrow) to
    reset the data\u2019s position."
